+// The Responsive Lab panel: the controls beside the viewport canvas, hosted
+// in a plain views::WebView inside AppSwapResponsiveLabOverlayView rather
+// than in a tab.
+//
+// The lab this page drives is threaded in via
+// AppSwapResponsiveLabPanelBridge, whose token the overlay embeds in this
